{"seq":16,"trial_id":"shared-brain-access-2026-11/hermes-opus-gbrain-labelled-mu-v031-dev/sy-01-quarrendon-ticket-numbers/r2","wall_ts":"2026-11-22T19:42:55.097Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"efd83126c4a1c5b21713b15aa4d680d368d7e5ec74069e519d16b969ebbee586","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DSHARED0001","text":"Hi Dana. I went through all six of Moss's notes (the North and Central digests under teams/*/digests). Two Quarrendon Freight Lines ticket numbers come up:\n\n- #PD-4492: \"Moss: Sunday prep for Ruth\" (teams/team-north/digests/2025-10-05-north-sunday.md). Thea Ramaswell filed it on 4 Oct 2025. Drivers at the Eau Claire yard (Dock Doors 14-18) weren't getting SMS bay assignments at gatehouse kiosk check-in. Support patched it the same evening, and Thea confirmed the 5 Oct 04:00 shift got through fine.\n- #4419: \"Moss: North cheat sheet (undated)\" (teams/team-north/digests/north-account-cheatsheet.md). Thea logged it because the gatehouse barcode scanners weren't reading trailer tags at Door 14 on third shift. It was escalated to tier-2 for scanner firmware testing. The note has no date.\n\nThe other four Moss notes don't have a QFL ticket. The 9/14 pipeline digest and the 3/23 renewal check-in mention QFL but give no ticket number. #4409, #4412 and FR-882 in the Central notes are for Central accounts, not QFL.\n\nTwo more numbers turned up that aren't from Moss, in case you want them: #4912 is in the QFL account profile (Gate_Dwell_Daily lag at Superior, Bay 14), and #8841 is in your own 9 Apr renewal debrief notes (carrier portal CSV upload timeout). Also, Marcus's note on \"Quarendon Freightways\" is about a different company that isn't a customer, so I left it out."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DSHARED0001","ts":"1791987000.000124"}}
